#ASSERT `Is the body that hurt me a public authority` `police` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `not PA declared`
#ASSERT `Is the body that hurt me a public authority` `private body` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `not PA declared`
#ASSERT `is a public authority` `PA court admin`
#ASSERT `is a public authority` `PA on behalf`
#ASSERT NOT (`is a public authority` `not PA`)
