§§ `s 38 -- Was the act unlawful under the Charter`

-- kind, public functions, on behalf, admin capacity, declared to be, declared not to be, day, private nature,
-- no reasonable choice, religious body, right limited, limit justified, a decision, proper consideration
-- police, 14 March 2025: a right limited without justification
#ASSERT `Was the act unlawful under the Charter` `police` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 14 3 2025) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `unlawful incompatible`
