#ASSERT `Was the act unlawful under the Charter` `police` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2008) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `unlawful incompatible`
#ASSERT `Was the act unlawful under the Charter` `police` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 14 3 2025) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `s38 private`
#ASSERT `Was the act unlawful under the Charter` `police` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 14 3 2025) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `s38 no choice`
#ASSERT `Was the act unlawful under the Charter` `police` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 14 3 2025) FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `s38 religious`
-- a private prison operator under contract with the State
