§§ `s 32 -- Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights`

-- kind of law, day proceeding commenced, day of reading, override made, override in operation from, earlier expiry given, earlier expiry
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic Act` (`d` 1 6 2025) (`d` 2 2 2026) FALSE `unused` FALSE `unused` EQUALS `read compatibly`
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic instrument` (`d` 1 6 2025) (`d` 2 2 2026) FALSE `unused` FALSE `unused` EQUALS `read compatibly`
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Cth law` (`d` 1 6 2025) (`d` 2 2 2026) FALSE `unused` FALSE `unused` EQUALS `s32 not statutory`
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `common law` (`d` 1 6 2025) (`d` 2 2 2026) FALSE `unused` FALSE `unused` EQUALS `s32 not statutory`
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `other place law` (`d` 1 6 2025) (`d` 2 2 2026) FALSE `unused` FALSE `unused` EQUALS `s32 not statutory`
-- s 49(2): commenced the day before Part 2, and on that day
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic Act` (`d` 31 12 2006) (`d` 2 2 2026) FALSE `unused` FALSE `unused` EQUALS `s32 old proceeding`
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic Act` (`d` 1 1 2007) (`d` 31 12 2007) FALSE `unused` FALSE `unused` EQUALS `s32 not yet`
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic Act` (`d` 1 1 2007) (`d` 1 1 2008) FALSE `unused` FALSE `unused` EQUALS `read compatibly`
-- an override in operation from 10 May 2023: in force to 9 May 2028, expired on its 5th anniversary, 10 May 2028
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic Act` (`d` 1 6 2025) (`d` 2 2 2026) TRUE (`d` 10 5 2023) FALSE `unused` EQUALS `s32 override`
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic Act` (`d` 1 6 2025) (`d` 9 5 2028) TRUE (`d` 10 5 2023) FALSE `unused` EQUALS `s32 override`
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic Act` (`d` 1 6 2025) (`d` 10 5 2028) TRUE (`d` 10 5 2023) FALSE `unused` EQUALS `read compatibly`
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic Act` (`d` 1 6 2022) (`d` 9 5 2023) TRUE (`d` 10 5 2023) FALSE `unused` EQUALS `read compatibly`
-- an override extended to an instrument made under the Act (s 31(2))
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic instrument` (`d` 1 6 2025) (`d` 2 2 2026) TRUE (`d` 10 5 2023) FALSE `unused` EQUALS `s32 override`
-- an earlier expiry day of 1 January 2025
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic Act` (`d` 1 6 2024) (`d` 31 12 2024) TRUE (`d` 10 5 2023) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2025) EQUALS `s32 override`
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic Act` (`d` 1 6 2024) (`d` 1 1 2025) TRUE (`d` 10 5 2023) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2025) EQUALS `read compatibly`
-- an "earlier" date that is later than the anniversary does not extend it
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic Act` (`d` 1 6 2025) (`d` 10 5 2028) TRUE (`d` 10 5 2023) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2030) EQUALS `read compatibly`
-- an override in operation from 29 February 2024: in force on 27 February 2029, expired on 28 February 2029
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic Act` (`d` 1 6 2025) (`d` 27 2 2029) TRUE (`d` 29 2 2024) FALSE `unused` EQUALS `s32 override`
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Vic Act` (`d` 1 6 2025) (`d` 28 2 2029) TRUE (`d` 29 2 2024) FALSE `unused` EQUALS `read compatibly`
-- an override cannot help with a Commonwealth law: s 32 never reached it
#ASSERT `Must the court read the statute compatibly with my rights` `Cth law` (`d` 1 6 2025) (`d` 2 2 2026) TRUE (`d` 10 5 2023) FALSE `unused` EQUALS `s32 not statutory`

